  "title": "Make-Ahead Sour Cream Coffee Cake",
  "description": "This yummy make-ahead coffee cake is chilled overnight before baking so it’s all ready for you to pop in the oven for a hot, fragrant morning treat.",
  "authors": [
    "It's A New Day"
  ],
